# Research (docs/re-party-chat.md section 9): does vanilla's yes/no op 0x31 work inside the Y chat?
# Vanilla ROM copy (build/chat/vroom.nds), start save, Jian's room. After Y, the stop after the room hint
# (018 0x51D8; the script copy sits at 0x02288480, found by chat_choice_vfind.plan) becomes
# `31 0000, yes -> 0x51F0 ("Hold on... Fountain Square"), no -> 0x51E4 ("Oh, Lucia!")`.
# This copy answers with: press B 3
include boot_from_save
wait 60
press Y 3
wait 2
peek u32 0x020B4644 hint_ctx
poke u32 0x0228D658 0x31
poke u32 0x0228D65C 0x51F0
poke u32 0x0228D660 0x51E4
dump 0x0228D648 0x20 leaf_after
wait 150
shot c_msg
press A 3
wait 60
shot c_prompt
peek u32 0x0228825C pc_ctx
press B 3
wait 60
shot c_branch
peek u32 0x0228825C pc_ctx
press A 3
wait 60
shot c_end
peek u32 0x020B4644 hint_ctx_after
